_title":"Introduction","source":{"current_hash_method":"tex-environment-body-comments-removed","current_statement_sha256":"sha256:df05e702ac6688764eec59babca61f7d47be562361a8e824568fdf31d18c2097","file":"preprints/Radius-of-comparison-equals-half-the-mean-dimension-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex","line":153,"producer_hash_method":"atlas-whitespace-normalized-text","producer_statement_sha256":"2b979de2d5bc468d4221d139eacc76ff6e5aeef6b761657a636cf30ea39c32c0","provenance":{"kind":"computed","pin":"fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb","source":"preprints/Radius-of-comparison-equals-half-the-mean-dimension-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex"},"sha256":"sha256:df05e702ac6688764eec59babca61f7d47be562361a8e824568fdf31d18c2097","url":"https://github.com/openai/math/blob/fd4aeeb2ee4fc729c18d98444fed42fd0529eeeb/preprints/Radius-of-comparison-equals-half-the-mean-dimension-September-25-2026/build/sections/01-introduction.tex#L153"},"statement_kind":"corollary","text":"\\label{cor:regularity}\nLet \\(h\\) be a minimal homeomorphism of an infinite compact metrizable\nspace \\(X\\), and put \\(A=C(X)\\rtimes_h\\Z\\). The following conditions are\nequivalent:\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item \\(\\mdim(X,h)=0\\);\n\\item \\((X,h)\\) has the small boundary property;\n\\item \\(A\\cong A\\otimes\\mathcal Z\\);\n\\item \\(\\dim_{\\mathrm{nuc}}(A)<\\infty\\);\n\\item \\(\\dim_{\\mathrm{nuc}}(A)\\le1\\).\n\\end{enumerate}\nIn particular, if \\(\\mdim(X,h)\\in(0,\\infty]\\), then\n\\(A\\not\\cong A\\otimes\\mathcal Z\\) and\n\\(\\dim_{\\mathrm{nuc}}(A)=\\infty\\)."}
